<style>
  .gym-designer-guide { padding: 16px 16px 40px; }
  .gym-designer-guide__inner { max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .gym-designer-guide h2 { text-align: center; margin: 0 0 24px; }
  .gym-designer-guide__steps, .gym-designer-guide__cases { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 16px; }
  .gym-designer-guide__step, .gym-designer-guide__case { border: 1px solid rgba(35,35,43,.16); border-radius: 16px; padding: 20px; background: #fff; }
  .gym-designer-guide__step h3, .gym-designer-guide__case h3 { margin: 0 0 8px; }
  .gym-designer-guide__step p, .gym-designer-guide__case p { margin: 0; }
  .gym-designer-guide__planner { margin: 32px 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.45fr) minmax(260px, .55fr); gap: 24px; align-items: center; }
  .gym-designer-guide__planner img { width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 16px; border: 1px solid rgba(35,35,43,.16); display: block; }
  .gym-designer-guide__note { border-left: 4px solid #D83D0E; padding: 12px 16px; background: #f8f8f8; margin: 24px 0 36px; }
  .gym-designer-guide__case a { display: inline-block; margin-top: 12px; font-weight: 700; }
  .gym-designer-guide__case img { display: block; width: 100%; height: 180px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 10px; margin: 0 0 16px; }
  .gym-designer-guide__caption { text-align: center; max-width: 860px; margin: -12px auto 20px; color: #56565e; }
  @media only screen and (min-width: 990px) {
    .side-bar-comtainer:has(.gym-designer-guide) > .sidebarmenu { position: sticky; top: 0; max-height: 100vh; overflow-y: auto; align-self: flex-start; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .gym-designer-guide { padding: 8px 16px 24px; }
    .gym-designer-guide__steps, .gym-designer-guide__cases, .gym-designer-guide__planner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
<section class="gym-designer-guide">
  <div class="gym-designer-guide__inner">
    <h2>How it works</h2>
    <div class="gym-designer-guide__steps">
      <div class="gym-designer-guide__step"><h3>1. Measure your space</h3><p>Have your room length, width, ceiling height, doors, fixed obstructions and training goals ready.</p></div>
      <div class="gym-designer-guide__step"><h3>2. Explore a conceptual layout</h3><p>Drag equipment onto your floor plan and review the concept in 2D or 3D. The planner is for early visualization, not final fit validation.</p></div>
      <div class="gym-designer-guide__step"><h3>3. Request a Sales review and quote</h3><p>Share your room dimensions, equipment goals, delivery ZIP, budget, timeline and installation needs, plus any layout you have already created. Our team will review your requirements and follow up to prepare a quote. You do not need to complete the planner first.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="gym-designer-guide__planner">
      <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0884/2012/2940/files/gym-designer-planner-example-2026-09-08.png?v=1791323406" alt="Sanitized Fitness Superstore Room Planner conceptual layout example" loading="lazy" width="1718" height="864">
      <div><h2>What to expect in the planner</h2><p>Equipment is placed by dragging it onto the floor plan. This sanitized internal example shows the current 2D planning view and the 2D/3D controls.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="gym-designer-guide__note"><strong>Saving is not requesting a quote.</strong> Saving a project asks for your name, email and phone, stores the layout for continued use, and sends the project link to the email entered in the save flow. To request a quote, use <strong>Get a Custom Gym Plan &amp; Quote</strong>. You do not need to complete the planner first.</div>
    <h2>Customer Gyms Featuring Our Equipment</h2>
    <p class="gym-designer-guide__caption">These links show completed customer installations, not output from the current Room Planner. The Northville case study also includes a historical rendering-to-completed-gym comparison; that rendering is not identified here as current Room Planner output.</p>
    <div class="gym-designer-guide__cases">
      <div class="gym-designer-guide__case"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0884/2012/2940/articles/Image_10_49b45379-f492-476d-8ad1-c08141a99f7d.jpg?v=1777408039" alt="Completed customer gym — G4 Fitness" loading="lazy" width="600" height="360"><h3>G4 Fitness</h3><p>Caddo Mills, TX &middot; 5,000 sq ft</p><a href="/blogs/case-studies/case-study-g4-fitness">View case study</a></div>
      <div class="gym-designer-guide__case"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0884/2012/2940/articles/Image_6v_2_6cc24484-6f4d-478f-abd3-36f9221b1f7b.jpg?v=1777407636" alt="Completed customer gym — Revitalize Fitness" loading="lazy" width="600" height="360"><h3>Revitalize Fitness</h3><p>Elizabeth City, NC &middot; 5,000 sq ft</p><a href="/blogs/case-studies/case-study-revitalized-fitness">View case study</a></div>
      <div class="gym-designer-guide__case"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0884/2012/2940/articles/image2_6_21044fcf-943c-4d63-896e-fd6e79d1a2db.jpg?v=1777407485" alt="Completed customer gym — Private Home Gym - Northville, MI" loading="lazy" width="600" height="360"><h3>Private Home Gym - Northville, MI</h3><p>Approximately 807 sq ft</p><a href="/blogs/case-studies/private-home-gym-northville-mi">View case study</a></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
